flowchart TB
  RT[SDDK Kernel / Pack Runtime]
  CORE[Core Vocabulary]
  INFRA[Infrastructure Packs
Evidence / bridges / adapters]
  DOMAIN[Domain Packs
UAT / Testing / Architecture / Research / Docs]
  BRIDGE[Bridge Packs
Cognicode / external ontologies]
  BUNDLE[Bundles
Named compositions only]
  RT --> CORE
  CORE --> INFRA
  CORE --> DOMAIN
  CORE --> BRIDGE
  INFRA -. integrates_with .-> DOMAIN
  BRIDGE -. emits core mappings .-> CORE
  BUNDLE --> INFRA
  BUNDLE --> DOMAIN
